    "The job name is set to 'GROMACS_JOB' (`-J GROMACS_JOB`), but the application being loaded and executed is NAMD (`module load NAMD/2.9` and `flux run namd2`). This is misleading and could cause confusion when monitoring jobs or analyzing resource usage logs.",
